# WAHA API Tests - WhatsApp HTTP API
# Documentación: https://waha.devlike.pro/docs/how-to/sessions/

@apiUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = 0148d3609e824423acf609c15f2b42b8
@session = default

# ============================================
# SESIONES
# ============================================

### 1. Listar todas las sesiones
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/sessions
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 2. Crear nueva sesión (sin iniciar)
# Response: { "name": "default", "status": "STARTING", ... }
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sessions
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{session}}",
  "start": true
}

### 3. Obtener estado de una sesión específica
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/sessions/{{session}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 4. Iniciar sesión (si ya fue creada pero está detenida)
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sessions/{{session}}/start
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 5. Detener sesión
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sessions/{{session}}/stop
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 6. Reiniciar sesión
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sessions/{{session}}/restart
x-apiKey: {{apiKey}}

### 7. Cerrar sesión (logout de WhatsApp)
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sessions/{{session}}/logout
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 8. Eliminar sesión
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/api/sessions/{{session}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

# ============================================
# AUTENTICACIÓN - QR Code
# ============================================

### 9. Obtener QR Code (GET - para vincular WhatsApp)
# Response: { "mimetype": "image/png", "data": "base64..." }
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/{{session}}/auth/qr
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. Obtener QR en formato binario (imagen)
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/{{session}}/auth/qr
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: image/png

### 11. Obtener código de emparejamiento (Pairing Code)
# Útil para vincular sin escanear QR
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/{{session}}/auth/request-code
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "59167023053"
}

### 12. Verificar cuenta vinculada (Get Me)
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/sessions/{{session}}/me
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

# ============================================
# ENVÍO DE MENSAJES
# ============================================

### 13. Enviar mensaje de texto
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sendText
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session": "{{session}}",
  "phone": "59167023053",
  "text": "Hola desde WAHA! 👋"
}

### 14. Enviar mensaje con línea nueva
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sendText
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session": "{{session}}",
  "phone": "59167023053",
  "text": "Línea 1\nLínea 2\nLínea 3"
}

### 15. Enviar mensaje con markdown básico
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sendText
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session": "{{session}}",
  "phone": "59167023053",
  "text": "*Negrita* _cursiva_ ~tachado~"
}

### 16. Enviar mensaje a múltiples destinatarios
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sendText
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session": "{{session}}",
  "phone": "59167023053",
  "text": "Mensaje broadcast",
  "delay": 1000
}

# ============================================
# RECEPCIÓN DE MENSAJES
# ============================================

### 17. Obtener chats (lista de conversaciones)
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/chats?session={{session}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 18. Obtener mensajes de un chat
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/chats/{{session}}/59167023053/messages
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 19. Obtener contactos
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/contacts?session={{session}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

# ============================================
# WEBHOOKS (para recibir mensajes en tiempo real)
# ============================================

### 20. Crear sesión con webhook
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sessions
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{session}}",
  "config": {
    "webhooks": [
      {
        "url": "http://localhost:3000/api/webhooks/whatsapp",
        "events": [
          "message",
          "session.status"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}

# ============================================
# ESTADOS DE SESIÓN
# ============================================
# STOPPED - Sesión creada pero no iniciada
# STARTING - Iniciando sesión
# SCAN_QR_CODE - Requiere escanear QR
# WORKING - Sesión activa y lista
# FAILED - Error en la sesión

### 21. Obtener screenshot de la sesión (binario)
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/screenshot?session={{session}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: image/png

### 22. Obtener screenshot (base64)
GET {{apiUrl}}/api/screenshot?session={{session}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Accept: application/json